- P11 + NET P11 + DIRECTION INOUT + FIXED ( 300000 100000 ) N ;
- P12 + NET P12 + DIRECTION INOUT + FIXED ( 320000 100000 ) N ;
END PINS

NETS 12 ;
- P1 ( PIN P1 )
  + ROUTED M1 180 ( 100000 100000 ) ( 3184948 100000 )
  + NEW M2 300 ( 100000 100000 ) M1M2_V1 ( 100000 532999 ) ;
- P2 ( PIN P2 )
  + ROUTED M1 180 ( 120000 100000 ) ( 3204948 100000 )
