  + NEW M2 300 ( 160000 100000 ) M1M2_V1 ( 160000 532999 ) ;
- P5 ( PIN P5 )
  + ROUTED M1 180 ( 180000 100000 ) ( 3264948 100000 )
  + NEW M2 300 ( 180000 100000 ) M1M2_V1 ( 180000 532999 ) ;
- P6 ( PIN P6 )
  + ROUTED M1 180 ( 200000 100000 ) ( 3284948 100000 )
  + NEW M2 300 ( 200000 100000 ) M1M2_V1 ( 200000 532999 ) ;
- P7 ( PIN P7 )
  + ROUTED M1 180 ( 220000 100000 ) ( 3304948 100000 )
  + NEW M2 300 ( 220000 100000 ) M1M2_V1 ( 220000 532999 ) ;
